// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// A9. ROLLUP evaluates a measure again for each grouping set.
// Question: What is the average salary of each department, and of the whole
//   company?
// On the total row, AGG(avg_sal) is the average over all 14 employees
// (2073.21). It is not the average of the three department averages
// (2219.44).
// Spec: 7.4, G1 (8.2)
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// KQL: ROLLUP evaluates a measure again for each grouping set: the total row is the average over all employees, not the average of the department averages.
FIND emp e
FETCH e.deptno ASC, agg(e.emp_count) empcount, agg(e.avg_sal) avgsal ROLLUP
